00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.110
It's tiny!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.790
Hey, what?! No!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.360
I hate homework!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.650
I don't wanna do it!

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:07.450
I know how you feel, but...

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:11.190
Marine Dynamite!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.350
Are you all right?

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.720
I just don't feel as powerful as normal.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.780
It's because you didn't have a proper breakfast!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.180
The summer heat is getting to you!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:26.680
That'sh right!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.330
There's still more of them?!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.100
They keep on coming.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.130
Hark, my Desertrians!

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.400
If you don't like homework,

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.730
then why not just get rid of your school?

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:38.440
Huh?!

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.530
That's right.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.900
We should just destroy the school!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.370
He's right!

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:49.580
Let's all go and destroy the school!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.290
Okay!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:56.140
Um, would you mind doing the 
middle school while you're at it?

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.300
Marine!

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:58.250
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.410
We'd better head to the elementary school!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.150
Right!

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:06.310
I hate homework!

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.800
We hate it!

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:14.770
Let's knock down the school! Knock it down! 
Knock it down! Knock it down! Knock it down!

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:19.570
That's right! If you hate doing your 
homework, then just destroy your school!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.690
Right!

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.240
Look, you!

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.410
Don't start talking like you understand!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:34.750
You don't know how it feels to worry about your homework!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.770
You're quite right. I don't.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.080
If you don't want to do it, then don't. Simple as that.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.970
Huh?! I can do that?!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.080
No, you can't!

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.540
Yeah, I figured.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:49.010
This shall be the first step to making this world a desert.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:53.490
By encouraging the lethargy in children's 
hearts, we can make it grow even stronger.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:57.270
Then we destroy their school and deprive them of their curiosity.{literally "will to learn", but I think curiosity works in a general sort of "desire to accumulate knowledge" sense rather than a "STUDY BOOKS" sense.} {Sure, yeah.}

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:02.360
Until finally, their willpower and their 
hopes for the future fade into nothing.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:07.530
And once they do, the Flowers of their Hearts 
shall wilt, and the Great Heart Tree shall perish!

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.480
And this world shall become a desert!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:14.460
Ah, je suis impeccable.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.790
I won't let you! {dat kobraja}

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:29.260
The reason we have summer homework is so we don't forget all the things we've learned!

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.300
So we don't forget all that time we spent studying!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.350
It's true that it can be a chore at times, but that's not what it's really about!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.770
Please try to remember! Remember just how fun learning can be!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.990
Is it, though?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.100
Marine! Just whose side are you on?!

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:54.550
Well, Tsubomi can say stuff like that cause she <i>likes</i> studying.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.040
Do you really think that, Marine?!

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:08.880
Running away from anything you find difficult, and making excuses so you don't have to work your hardest.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:09.970
Are you really okay with that?

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:13.680
Look out!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.570
Huh?

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:24.400
Destroy the school!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.800
Blossom! Sunshine!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.220
I've got to try harder than this!

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:47.070
Use a Heart Seed to get fired up!

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:47.920
All right!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.150
The Blessed Perfume of Magenta Light!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.420
A spray makes me ready for action!

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.830
I'm fired up now!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:05.940
Here I come!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:22.870
Precure Forehead Punch!

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:30.800
I know how you all feel, but you can't just destroy your school like this!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:34.800
Hmph! Humans are innately foolish creatures.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.800
Just going to school isn't going to change that.

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.740
You're wrong!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:43.080
Studying can be tough, but that's why we have school!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.510
If you're trying to destroy that, then...

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:50.440
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.620
Gather, Floral Power!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.840
Marine Tact!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.130
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:24.330
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:31.610
Homewoooooooork!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.760
Because the Desertrian's so big, her power alone isn't enough!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.070
Leave it to me!

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:48.580
Gather, Floral Power!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.070
Blossom Tact!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.930
Flowers, shine forth!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:11.230
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.610
Hoooooome... work!

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:19.990
Sunshine!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.030
Right!

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:33.800
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:37.730
Shiny Tambourine!

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.980
Flowers, dance for me!

00:18:54.880 --> 00:19:00.510
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.420
Tch!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:27.670
However, as long as summer homework remains undone, I have more chances!

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:30.560
Hey, all you kids who haven't done your summer homework yet!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.690
I'll be coming for you next! {This is still the best fourth-wall breaking.}

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:42.910
Huh?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.990
Why are we at school?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.940
I think you must've all zoned out because of the summer heat!

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:49.830
Yeah, that must be it.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.330
I see.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:55.290
What's the matter?

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:59.130
I was just thinking, summer 
vacation's gonna be over soon.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.320
Everyone sheems sho down.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:07.980
Because they haven't finished their homework, they feel burdened!

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:09.430
Hey, you kids.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.890
What are you doing here?

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:12.100
Sir!{just a "sensei!". IDK HOW DO YOU REFER TO YOUR TEACHERS IN CRAZY YANKEELAND} {Mr./Ms./Mrs. XXXX generally. Sir works fine here!}

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.600
Why are you here at school?

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:15.810
It's summer vacation. {the summer holiday -> summer vacation}

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.500
Even during the vacation, there's always a teacher here. {holidays -> vacation}

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.780
You can always ask for our help if you need to.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.200
Oh, I know!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:28.400
I think they're all struggling 
with parts of their homework.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.080
Huh?

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:35.670
If you get your homework finished, you'll be able to enjoy the rest of the holiday without worrying about it!

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.960
Sir, can you help me with my homework?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:40.420
Mine too!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.010
Oh, mine too!

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.590
Okay! Let's head to a classroom, then!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.740
Yes, sir!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:50.030
Erika, you should finish yours too.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.220
Fine.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.860
I'm glad they were able to help all those kids!

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:58.940
Wait! This means we're going to get a ton of Heart Seeds!

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:02.540
Potpourri, ready the Heart Pot!

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.780
Okay, shir!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:15.950
With this, the Great Heart Tree 
has recovered a whole lot more!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.370
Here's a hint: formulas.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:24.840
Oh, I see!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.290
I-I did it!

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:32.790
I finally solved it. Wow.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.810
It's kinda fun when you finally work it out.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:39.110
That's right! When you finally understand what 
you're studying, that's when it becomes interesting!

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:41.980
"A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step."{Confucius, don'tcha know.}

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:47.280
If you work on things one step at a time, I'm 
sure even you'll begin to enjoy studying, Erika!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:47.950
Right!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:51.910
Now then, let's keep this pace up and get them all finished!

