So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:04.310
All those

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:08.890
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:14.160
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:16.830
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:21.040
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:27.180
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.270
With all our might!

