<i>Hayashi travels tough and steep roads on his bicycle.</i>

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:50.450
<i>No matter how many people tell him he can't 
do it, he believes in himself and never gives up.</i>

00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:54.410
<i>Because when he reaches his goal, it'll be the memory of a lifetime.</i>

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:56.230
<i>That's why I've made my decision!</i>

00:23:56.230 --> 00:23:59.860
<i>I'll find that new side of myself and make a beautiful dress!</i>

